ROOT CAUSE FOUND (bot.py learned-block): the STUCK_BLOCK mechanism blacklists a tile whenever a char's
move fails to land, but NEVER checked WHY. Run #99 had 9687 not_enough_stamina move errors and ~0 wall
bounces -> the learned-block was almost entirely poisoning walkable 'path' tiles from the frame-stale
stamina margin. Traced exactly: Recruit-15172 rested at (24,26) sta48 with a CLEAR 'path' tile at
(24,25) it refused because an earlier stamina bounce had learned-blocked it for 150 ticks -> died one
step from safety. This likely underlies the ~73% "stuck" deaths across the whole arc.
