learn-block on not_enough_stamina (tile is fine; the stamina margin already stops re-issuing an
unaffordable move, so nothing thrashes; real wall bounces still learn-block). (2) NET: DESPERATION
ESCAPE — a hurt char whose retreat finds no known-walkable step steps onto any clear non-wall neighbour
(even unseen), farthest from enemies; strictly better than resting to death. Scored 8.0 < retreat 8.5.
