ROOT (confirmed from the recruit-decision reasoning): the gate logged "roster 9 < 10" at t+0, t+80 AND
t+176 on #100 — the count was FROZEN at 9 for ~176 ticks while the real roster was ~30. Cause: the gate
trusts bot.spectate.counts() (public /api/spectate/guilds total), and that SERVER endpoint lagged our
post-deploy roster (reported us as 9 for ~176 ticks then jumped to 30). The client freshness check can't
catch server-side staleness (the fetch succeeded). So it recruited every cooldown -> 21-char bare bench.
