fresh frame snapshot here+fielded) — a low read from either is the stale one, the max is the truer floor;
+ count our own in-flight recruits (RECRUIT_INFLIGHT_TTL=100) so the startup window where BOTH read the
not-yet-checked-in roster can't fire a burst (each issued recruit lifts the estimate immediately, capping
it at ~1 until the counts catch up). Mirrors the embark in-flight guard.
