PREMISE CHECK 1 — is gold actually stuck? Gold by fifths of each run: #115 [159.6,140.3,144.5,140.3,144.9]
max 177; #116 [156.6,180.8,186.5,197.9,195.9] max 207; #117 [164.6,145.4,142.3,146.6,144.8] max 197. So it
hovers ~145 and has NEVER sustained the 200 ARMOR_BUY_FLOOR: the armor buy shipped in 0.47 has literally
