    explorer/0.59.0 -> {'move': 455, 'embark': 55}
    explorer/0.58.0 -> {'move': 455, 'embark': 55}
byte-identical. The offline probe never reproduced field opportunism at all, so it was never
evidence about 0.59 in the first place; I had read a property of the PROBE as a property of
