Measure it when loot returns.
THIS IS THE ARGUMENT FOR THE BAND-REFRESH WISHLIST ITEM (0.532): the frame carries
`next_refresh: {band, in_ticks}` and we ignore it completely, so a band that starves the
economy is indistinguishable to us from a bot that has broken — which is exactly the
confusion that cost this pass its measurement.

