tome is genuinely surplus; a frame without `spell_cap` reads "no room" rather than "room for
one" (an unknown capability is not a guess to act on). Learn-by-rejection on (char, kind)
since INT gates which tomes a character may use; `use` also drinks potions (2,582 sent), so
a failed potion condemns nothing.
NOT CLAIMED: that magic works. A form in a head is not a spell thrown. Casting is the next
slice and now has a satisfiable prerequisite.
