iter 78 — 2026-08-22 — the latch audit: what restores an option? (0.65.0/0.65.1, #142/#143)
================================================================================
FIRST, 0.64.0 IS CONFIRMED. Forge SUCCESS RATE 35% -> 68% (8 of 23 actions on #140, 13 of 19
