WHAT THE CORRECTED DATA SHOWED INSTEAD. Run #143's 23 forge attempts, in order: ONE character
(c16004) spent 20 of them re-walking the ladder — shield_iron (1,1)x4, (2,1)x3, (1,2)x3,
