a test that contradicts the system.

THE PATTERN WORTH CARRYING: this is the SECOND time a well-reasoned constant outlived its
evidence (v0.35.0's reserve here; v0.8.0's stranded-singleton rule in 0.59.0, which was right
for abundant items and wrong for scarce chain inputs). Both were correct when written, both
were justified in comments that read persuasively years later, and neither had anything
watching whether the premise still held. WHEN A CONSTANT CARRIES A JUSTIFICATION, THE
JUSTIFICATION IS A CLAIM ABOUT THE WORLD — and claims about the world expire.

