ZERO — precisely the 0.24.0 drain — left it green. Numbers written out.

OPERATOR ASKED: do rivals use magic? NO — AND NOBODY DOES. Across 6,484 spectate snapshots
and ~340k character observations covering all five guilds, ZERO implements (wand/scepter/
staff/rod) have ever been equipped, and only 9 bow sightings. WillMorr (the dev's own
guild, max level 38) is 73% bare-handed and otherwise dagger/club/spear. The shop sells
tome_veil 120g and tome_bolt 150g but NO implements, so those must drop or be forged and
