instant the tome is bought. Bottles (2g, the heal supply) left alone — a 2g drain isn't
worth starving brewing. BUILD BUG CAUGHT BY TEST: saving_for_tome was computed BEFORE the
frame's chars were noted into the seat ledger, so the current wizard wasn't a seat yet and
saving never engaged -> note-first fix. 5 tests (armour-suppressed / tome-still-buys /
no-saving-below-gate / releases-after-buy / pinned literal); 5/5 mutants killed. This is
the payoff lever of the whole arming arc: arm -> fight -> level -> INT 6 -> and now SAVE
